.TH elfshaker-list-packs 1  "elfshaker 1.0.0-rc1" "elfshaker Manual"
.SH NAME
elfshaker\-list\-packs \- Prints the list of packs available in the repository.
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBelfshaker list\-packs\fR [\fB\-\-format\fR] [\fB\-\-verbose\fR] [\fB\-\-data\-dir\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Prints the list of packs available in the repository.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-format\fR [default: %p]
Pretty\-print each result in the given format, where <format> is a string containing one or more of the following placeholders:
	%p \- pack
	%h \- human\-readable size
	%b \- size in bytes
	%c \- number of snapshots

.TP
\fB\-\-verbose\fR
Enables verbose description of the execution process.
.TP
\fB\-\-data\-dir\fR [default: elfshaker_data]
Set the path to the elfshaker repository.
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
